      },
      {
        "step_number": 2,
        "instruction": "Meanwhile, sauté the chopped onion in oil until translucent, then add garlic and ground beef. Cook, breaking up the meat, until browned.",
        "timer_seconds": 600
      },
      {
        "step_number": 3,
        "instruction": "Stir in tomato paste, chopped tomatoes, peppers, parsley, cumin, salt, and pepper. Simmer until the filling thickens slightly.",
        "timer_seconds": 600
      },
      {
        "step_number": 4,
        "instruction": "Make a lengthwise slit in each eggplant and gently open it. Fill with the meat mixture and arrange in a baking dish.",
        "timer_seconds": 0
      },
      {
        "step_number": 5,
